{"title":"2025 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Small)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Small)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Clear_Concept)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Clear Concept)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(More_detailed_version_of_solution_2)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (More detailed version of solution 2)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~0:40)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~0:40)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Quick_and_Easy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Quick and Easy)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Chinese_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Chinese Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SpreadTheMathLove\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SpreadTheMathLove</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(In_1_Min)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (In 1 Min)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Continuum_Math_(FAST)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Continuum Math (FAST)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are real numbers. When the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/a/8da2616f4e1a4b82c091dd19e51eb7b349e23585.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3+x^2+ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. When the polynomial is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4e0c9fe53284fc1fc418baf62e3a7253237ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/c/02c60c151331e235dc6d9df7ca403b6f0c9af39b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />?\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/d/efd49bebcfe36e8ea34e66e6a9b93f383deac46b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 14 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 15 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 16 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 17 \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/l1RY_C20Q2M\">https://youtu.be/l1RY_C20Q2M</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use synthetic division to find that the remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/d/67d83b53ee1114475d36d46b522a6f6ec2e92610.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{3}+x^{2}+ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/5/8b58947ffd73a17ac2cf74e7009192559aa4d6cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfb6f145aba29c717ab75719181abe197a56efb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+b+12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"16\" /> when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4e0c9fe53284fc1fc418baf62e3a7253237ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />. Now, we solve\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/c/f6cf91e677570db0f427adec88a630b7d8f0fa68.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{cases} a+b+2=4 \\\\ 2a+b+12 = 6 \\\\ \\end{cases}\\]\" width=\"133\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>This ends up being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804e14fbf83835eed6b287548d53caaaafc2246d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c6598c0475f72c14c1bc58cb116cde326decce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80d01a8d17dbffe8506d9c0cef585f2e2cbac03e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=10-(-8)=\\fbox{\\textbf{(E)} 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"229\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Via the remainder theorem, we can plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in for the factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we have that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/2883a6420f781e54501e4275db84ec03aa2807e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1^3+1^2+1a+b=4\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/6/a16597f357a77877b557dd3c0b7da1cf5169f5df.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+b=2.\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />\nThen, we plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and get a remainder of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so we have that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1b62fc837f219d5a9940b5957fb83eb8df1a2e9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^3+2^2+2a+b=6\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48c78c74645d53d1e0a306e5efe1db5019ac21e0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[8+4+2a+b=6\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/bef7c8c22df8d85bd2f9ba40d1aeacd093c0fda0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a+b=-6\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"14\" />\nThen, we solve the system of equations.\nBy substitution, we obtain\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07a86b30ac142d99e6dd807e725cf811c2c2b574.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=2-a\\]\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/266213fe605f33006c4fef99ed0a9631bd09222e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2a+2-a=-6\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae8e9002393e286539b1ca671afa1f840332ee6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=-8\\]\" width=\"55\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/2/5c2fd4ec33f4dabc8374dad2121d242335102df2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=2-(-8)=2+8=10.\\]\" width=\"210\" height=\"18\" />\nThus, we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8d8895b25f952a101e13923db887746b9886dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=10-(-8)=10+8=\\fbox{\\textbf{(E)} 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"302\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~ranu540\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Small.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Small)\">Solution 3 (Small)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Small)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using Remainder theorem, we get that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f1e7bc8cee2d3598e991ebf8f8a1768a6f95fac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 = (1)^3 + (1)^2 + (1)a + b = 1 + 1 + a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"330\" height=\"21\" /> so we get  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d748bf67890f1987c44383623716278c104bc24a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 = a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> (i) and from the second statement,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/4/e74f07fe95f1abe416d8d7cf513429d62df6c332.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 = (2)^3 + (2)^2 + (2)a + b = 8 + 4 + 2a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"339\" height=\"21\" /> so we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be6ef889b3e6d8bb48dae5239c64854357f06d80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-6 = 2a + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> (ii).\n</p><p>So we Subtract (ii) from (i) to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef58d523a261bee6363ca944bdbe29b454986a42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" />. Substitute in to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7203b7e6f070ba402b9cd45dee2bfc125164fd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d0f6f0dbbd9e53fe9408bb55e69879402237c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b - a = 10 - (-8) = \\fbox{\\textbf{(E)} 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"229\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~Aarav22\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Clear_Concept.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Clear_Concept)\">Solution 4 (Clear Concept)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Clear Concept)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When the polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/7/5d71f3099ad97a77c77cabb51330c937b0e1ab17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x^3+x^2+ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"192\" height=\"21\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the remainder is\n</p>\n<pre><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/e/9de1b1e9b200500c42a2281b181f7964a2f9d228.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1)= 1+1 + a+ b =4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"196\" height=\"20\" /> , \n        <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4fe475529152080b84437b4479381825cb76fb6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b =2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />\n</pre>\n<p>When the polynomial is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/4/be4e0c9fe53284fc1fc418baf62e3a7253237ce7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, the remainder is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<pre>    <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d950f32c113d6ceefc30c46b77467c5342488ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2)= 8 + 4 + 2a+ b=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"205\" height=\"20\" /> , \n        <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c26211c0986cb4cf2b5ddd1f2ac386784b38c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + b = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />\n</pre>\n<p>Solving ,  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/a/8caf21cc3fe40dcba4baca09b9ee956b202c99ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/c/89c26211c0986cb4cf2b5ddd1f2ac386784b38c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + b = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/5/ef58d523a261bee6363ca944bdbe29b454986a42.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = -8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a7203b7e6f070ba402b9cd45dee2bfc125164fd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> ,\nhence , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/c/5ec6e25b4c7cb42882c53808bbb2f1d22151837d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a07d00f6343e79339f6c92aa5026645ee250bd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(E)} 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"63\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~KENJAKURA\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28More_detailed_version_of_solution_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(More_detailed_version_of_solution_2)\">Solution 5 (More detailed version of solution 2)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (More detailed version of solution 2)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/065fd8913fd7c913ead4229bedb81e4c576d25e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3 +x^2 +ax+b = q(x) \\cdot (x-1) +4= r(x)\\cdot (x-2) +6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"448\" height=\"21\" />. Plugging in x=1 will produce <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/d/e6d40d4e479d46fb19cab50e74383902ad4225f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^3 + 1^3 +a(1)+b=q(1)\\cdot(1-1) +4 \\to 2+a+b=4 \\to a+b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"531\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/25175d0e269ed8d27eef5420fe041de8f3941aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\newline$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"22\" />\nUsing the same method, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> will yield <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e104b0c5dde4a465edd9e62bd998d919820ab484.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+b=-6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />. Solving this system of equations yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804e14fbf83835eed6b287548d53caaaafc2246d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=-8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"59\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c6598c0475f72c14c1bc58cb116cde326decce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/d/0adf6524f26598d8c4fef75db4181311e6234d4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b-a=10-(-8)= \\fbox{\\textbf{(E)} 18}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"229\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~pandapower24\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_.28Logical.2C_Good_Editing.2C_.7E0:40.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_FormulaFocus_(Logical,_Good_Editing,_~0:40)\">Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~0:40)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by FormulaFocus (Logical, Good Editing, ~0:40)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/6on8yTokZBk\">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/6on8yTokZBk</a>\n</p><p>~Ebai\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gPh9w3X3QSw\">https://youtu.be/gPh9w3X3QSw</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Quick_and_Easy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Quick_and_Easy)\">Video Solution(Quick and Easy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Quick and Easy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T1Ejb9Skkao\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=T1Ejb9Skkao</a>\n~Sigma_Bob\n</p>\n<h2